   "section": "7",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "It became clear at LogiMAT: Your processes set the pace. Linde Material Handling combines with to create an automation solution that fits seamlessly into existing structures and can be flexibly expanded as needed."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "mobile and stationary systems"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "intelligent software"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "This creates end-to-end automation that not only speeds up processes, but also makes your entire material flow more transparent, stable, and predictable."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Your advantages"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Noticeably and"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "more efficient processes"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "higher throughput"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Better and"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "space utilization"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "predictable total cost of ownership"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "thanks to assistance systems and RTLS+"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Greater safety"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "– from the first step to full automation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Scalable system architecture"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
