  {
   "section": "8",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Mobile systems – flexible in material flow",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Intralogistics-Automation/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Standardized AGVs and AMRs handle transport, transfer, and storage and retrieval processes—quick to integrate, reliable in operation, and modularly expandable, for example with the L-MATIC core."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Intralogistics-Automation/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Stationary systems – compact and powerful",
     "href": "../../../en/Solutions/Intralogistics-Automation/S-MATIC-cube/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Shuttle and shelving systems such as the S-MATIC cube create high storage density and enable high turnover in a minimal space, ideal for dynamic and growing warehouse structures."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/Solutions/Intralogistics-Automation/S-MATIC-cube/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Software & orchestration – networked, transparent, AI-supported",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Revolutionizing-the-Warehouse-with-AI/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "The WMS Linde Warehouse Manager controls material flows holistically across all levels. myLinde bundles fleet, energy, and safety data, RTLS+ provides pinpoint real-time positions, and the digital twin (NVIDIA) accelerates the planning and simulation of your systems."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Revolutionizing-the-Warehouse-with-AI/index.html"
    }
   ],
