  {
   "section": "13",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Digital solutions – myLinde, RTLS+, and Digital Twin",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Fleet-Management/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Transparency at the touch of a button: myLinde brings fleet, safety, and energy data together in a clear dashboard. RTLS+ shows every vehicle in real time—for full process visibility. The digital twin (NVIDIA) enables fast simulations and targeted process optimizations."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "More about myLinde",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Fleet-Management/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Safety – smarter, safer, more transparent",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Warehouse-Safety/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Ergonomic concepts, intelligent assistance systems, and precisely engineered sightlines significantly reduce risks—both indoors and in dynamic outdoor environments."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "More about safety solutions",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Warehouse-Safety/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Energy – maximum availability, predictable costs",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Energy-Systems/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "With lithium-ion technology, the connect:charger, and intelligent energy management, you can increase the operational readiness of your fleet and ensure cost-effective operating processes."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "More about energy solutions",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/Solutions/Energy-Systems/"
    }
