     "order": 0,
     "text": "Live automation"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "I-MATIC AC core, L-MATIC core, and S-MATIC cube working together—including software orchestration."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Test drives in outdoor areas"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Try out Roadster, E, and Xi models live and enjoy the comfort of the new cab in our heavy-duty forklifts up to 18 tons."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Digital demos"
    },
    {
