  {
   "section": "17",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "This may also interest you"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Revolutionizing the Warehouse with AI",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Revolutionizing-the-Warehouse-with-AI/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Linde Material Handling is working with NVIDIA and Accenture to develop forward-thinking AI-based solutions for efficient and safe warehouse processes."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Revolutionizing-the-Warehouse-with-AI/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Technology & Innovation",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Like the company's founders in the past, the engineers and technicians of Linde Material Handling are developing efficient intralogistics solutions with ingenuity."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "https://www.linde-mh.com/en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Linde VertiLight and Linde LED Stripes",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-VertiLight-and-Linde-LED-Stripes.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Having the right amount of light at all times is essential to safety and efficiency when working with industrial trucks. With the Linde VertiLight and Linde LED Stripes, Linde Material Handling offers two innovative lighting concepts."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Linde-VertiLight-and-Linde-LED-Stripes.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Active Stability Control",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Active-Stability-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Very narrow aisle trucks are used for working at great height. The aisles are narrow and the distances to the rack are calculated very precisely. Because of that, even the slightest unevenness in the warehouse floor can become a problem. Linde Material Handling’s Active Stability Control assistance system for the K truck provides an innovative solution."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Active-Stability-Control.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "The Innovative Rack Protection System",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Rack-Protection-Sensor/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "The Linde Rack Protection Sensor automatically slows down the truck when approaching racks and prevents collisions and damage."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Innovations-from-Linde/Rack-Protection-Sensor/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Schenker takes full control of its forklift truck fleet",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/DB-Schenker/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "DB Schenker has full control of its forklift truck fleet thanks to Linde’s innovative fleet management system Linde connect."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/DB-Schenker/index.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "In use on the race track",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Linde-Rental-Service-for-Formula-Student-Germany.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "The Linde Rental Solutions has been ensuring fast and professional setup and dismantling as well as performing other logistics tasks at the Formula Student Germany for many years. This requires a number of challenges to be overcome."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Linde-Rental-Service-for-Formula-Student-Germany.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Robots as employee of the month",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Robots-as-employee-of-the-month.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "With the Robotics4Retail survey, the EHI Retail Institute is investigating how robotics and automation are revolutionizing intralogistics. Who are the drivers of automation and what comprehensive solutions and industrial trucks does Linde offer?"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Robots-as-employee-of-the-month.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Forklift trucks for dirty work",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Carolus_Trees.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "The forklift trucks used at Carolus Trees have to be tough – and most importantly, they can’t be afraid to get cold and dirty. Linde forklifts take this all in their stride."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Carolus_Trees.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "Full of tricks",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Frueh-Koelsch.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "Cölner Hofbräu P. Josef Früh KG in Cologne-Feldkassel brews and loads thousands of litres of Kölsch every day. Real hard work for Linde's lithium-ion forklifts, which passed their trial run at the company with flying colors."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Frueh-Koelsch.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "A thirst for innovation",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Veltins.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "Anyone brewing and bottling millions of hectoliters of Pilsener beer, shandy, malt beer, apple beer and other mixed beer beverages needs powerful intralogistics systems to get the drinks onto the street. C. & A. Veltins, a brewery with a rich tradition, has put its faith in forklifts from Linde Material Handling for this demanding role."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Veltins.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "Analyzed Efficiently",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Grass.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "For years, the hinge specialists at Reinheim-based Grass GmbH have been carrying out their warehouse and production logistics tasks using a forklift truck fleet that has grown gradually over time. Using a fleet optimization analysis, experts from Linde Material Handling identified an incredible amount of potential within this established structure. They standardized and reduced the fleet and, in the process, made it much more powerful, cost-efficient, and energy-saving."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "Learn more",
     "href": "../../../en/About-us/Magazine/Grass.html"
    }
   ],
